g", "id": "523862073769426", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001725_523862077102759_2585923295524221449_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zAW1sChfdaIQ7kNvwGtrWMj&_nc_oc=AdraVVqzotbav8V9E1DkFe8nUEVa8eYwOnjWVASnCrilNwyoruk6E1A3ANwF2Zi7Y48&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQHQc5yZS4Y9JtDbrC-lK66uNSsuNNIQdSmDdhNCJvfNA&oe=6B0D9B0C"}, {"file_name": "Screen1.png", "id": "3785070835112368", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974508_3785070838445701_6369773566651121864_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=H5AATRMP7J0Q7kNvwG9wLfj&_nc_oc=AdqWR3SFfmElIgXlXkliiqUlU5d58SU7bpdKGUlarsIzoquZASAgheG4VRpOAAUFPvs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSvJ1quRWf42BVCuiFirZTdsOb41WsIEpzf-DXcVmW9cg&oe=6B0DA2E0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "boxing_underdog_CoverImageLandscape.png", "id": "1616772642298879", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982526_1616772645632212_6905567547802219844_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QHDISuvOgQsQ7kNvwFRMv2K&_nc_oc=Adq2kcqNHhAHq3gIG1fRs6om9r8HTkkHiR7QqRGsXLXtja9X_nv_d2otbS3-4Gi5hQI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQdizJIjsJl99O1WLvdXfpo4gEjGvJ4lui2poVuXp38OA&oe=6B0DC741"}, "display_name": "Boxing Underdog", "keywords": ["boxing", "simulation", "fighting", "sport", "fitness"], "long_description": "**Experience the Future of Boxing**\n\nStep into the ring like never before with Boxing Underdog, the most realistic VR boxing simulation. Immerse yourself in lifelike graphics powered by a 100%  physics-based gameplay, delivering unparalleled realism.\n\n{1247567353111991}\n\n**Multiplayer: Fight the World**\n\nTake your skills online and challenge friends or opponents from around the globe in our robust multiplayer mode. Experience real-time boxing matches in VR, where you can test your abilities against others in a safe, virtual environment. Climb the global leaderboards as you strive to become the ultimate champion.\n\n**Train, Learn, Compete in Singleplayer**\n\nWhether you're new to boxing or a seasoned pro, Boxing Underdog offers training modules that mirror real-world mechanics. Develop your technique, improve your footwork, and master combinations in singleplayer mode. Then, challenge others in multiplayer \u2014all without any risk to your health.\n\n**Become the Ultimate Underdog**\n\nEmbark on a journey from underdog to champion. Overcome challenges, defy the odds, and rise through the ranks as you experience the true spirit of boxing.\n\n**Authentic Physics-Based Gameplay**\n\nOur advanced physics ensures every movement and impact feels real. Feel the weight of each punch and the satisfaction of landing a perfect strike.\n\n\n**Join the Fight**\n\nImprove while having fun in a safe, virtual environment. Whether you're looking to learn, train, or enjoy of boxing, Boxing Underdog offers an unmatched VR experience. Step into the ring and embrace the challenge!\n\n", "short_description": "Experience the ultimate boxing simulation in VR with Boxing Underdog. Featuring stunningly realistic graphics and 100% physics-based gameplay, immerse yourself in lifelike boxing action. Train, learn, and develop your skills in singleplayer and multiplayer modes without any risk to your health. Improve while having fun, and rise through training to become the ultimate boxing champion!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.monologic.games/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Damian Boczek - Gawliczek", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.monologic.games/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES